<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<!-- Maps SDK key. Mirrors the Android `secrets.xml` pattern —
	     the key still ships inside the IPA, so source-control
	     visibility is what this hides. The actual security boundary
	     is RESTRICTING the key in Google Cloud Console by iOS
	     bundle identifier (Maps SDK for iOS only, bundle ID
	     `mx.t_sty.click` or whatever your release ID is). Without
	     that console restriction, the key can be scraped from any
	     downloaded IPA. -->
	<key>GoogleMapsApiKey</key>
	<string>AIzaSyBHIP391u2W_3lOpOT3znjIzD6L3Fhm2Fw</string>
	<key>CADisableMinimumFrameDurationOnPhone</key>
	<true/>
	<key>FirebaseMessagingAutoInitEnabled</key>
	<true/>
	<key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
	<array>
		<string>remote-notification</string>
	</array>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>$(DEVELOPMENT_LANGUAGE)</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>T_STY</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>T_STY</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>APPL</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(FLUTTER_BUILD_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleSignature</key>
	<string>????</string>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(FLUTTER_BUILD_NUMBER)</string>
	<key>LSRequiresIPhoneOS</key>
	<true/>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Usamos tu ubicación para colocar el pin de tu dirección de entrega en el mapa y sugerir tu dirección automáticamente. La app no rastrea tu ubicación en segundo plano.</string>
	<key>NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Usamos tu ubicación para colocar el pin de tu dirección de entrega en el mapa y sugerir tu dirección automáticamente. La app no rastrea tu ubicación en segundo plano.</string>
	<key>UIApplicationSupportsIndirectInputEvents</key>
	<true/>
	<key>UILaunchStoryboardName</key>
	<string>LaunchScreen</string>
	<key>UIMainStoryboardFile</key>
	<string>Main</string>
	<key>UIRequiresFullScreen</key>
	<true/>
	<key>UIStatusBarHidden</key>
	<true/>
	<key>UIStatusBarStyle</key>
	<string></string>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
	</array>
	<key>io.flutter.embedded_views_preview</key>
	<true/>
</dict>
</plist>
